<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to March 14 .</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week Rank Name		     Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Village Road-Pr	3.52	8.31</p>
<p> 2   Capral Aluminium     4.83	6.15</p>
<p> 3   Village Roadshow     4.58	5.33</p>
